Package: oofetch
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign system fetch and environment showcase
 A fastfetch/neofetch drop-in replacement written in pure openOODA, featuring
 negative-trust capability security, instant terminal rendering, oote theme swatches,
 and a first-class MCP surface for agent callers.
